 <h2>Welcome</h2>

            <p>Welcome to my tiny web corner. This is my personal web space to replace social media profiles. In this site you will find all kinds of things I like and do, icluding my art and blog.</p>

            <p>This site is mostly friendly to all age groups. However, the blog might occationally contain disturbing topics and harsh language. Those posts are marked with a warning sign. </p>
            
            <p>Best viewed on desktop, but the site works on mobile too. I have also tried to make this site as accessible as I can. If the flame videos bother you, you can <button id="toggle-videos" aria-label="Toggle videos">turn them off</button>.</p>
            
            <p class="sml">You are free and encouraged to sign my guestbook ^_^</p>
            
            
